{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1328,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63570f932d04cfba31dbe397",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔～～Primavera来了！你知道从\r\n贝壳中诞生的爱之女神是谁吗……？\r\n没错……！就是即将改变世界的我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ee557a98e9c929ca11097ff018ca7843a85693779d4bd9301e1df4b0f5d4aff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7c0b4c530df8325f492032",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有记得好好防晒吗？紫外线不仅是\r\n美容大敌，在健康方面更是no呢！\r\n你也要照顾好自己喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c94ef52ebf20ab120e8689a3ee1945d447124e2152b08177052e72739880c5cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:231bd7ef4866637c943189be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼～♪今年也收集了好多\r\n躲在栗子壳中的褐色珍珠呢。\r\nSo sweet！So 开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b71fbee05309659f2cb05b1643f000393623fe0caacf693518bcfb1f5cd39c0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c50ab3a31741bc086caafedf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管多冷都不能穿得像包肉粽一样。\r\n所以我都会把暖暖包藏在看不见的\r\n地方，这就是采珠式作风……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b43084ba153003e22915109879c5d13255ca5cecddffc495bd6e47f62bb8e474",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dff54746eda906536ede3bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ンッン～、朝からラッキーね！\r\nこのパールスマイルを目にしたら、\r\n眠気なんて一瞬で吹き飛ぶでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8fe1dca5f95351988371238701a385c6f70c75e7112afe5a877664b186cf255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d9f7cedd6b27f2e3ebcc5ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ベストモーニング、トレーナー！\r\nグッドじゃないのかって？いいえ、\r\n私たちの朝は毎日最高でしょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a5d1da644aee6c1c7719865fb5d05504d8d15a30c083123d16df3d7643f0447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:521eec36dec80a5982092bce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アフタヌーンティー、今日は私が\r\n淹れてあげるわ。味の決め手は…\r\n漲るパッション！込めるわ～っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da79dac06ab0072494e678bc73889c61de99178e4439e1d34a3e79ac40b20530",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23bd4408550e6170a5ba7156",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェテリアのランチ、最近の\r\nオススメは…タレカツ定食よ！\r\n肉汁とタレが生み出す…新世界ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5090773171bee5bff20e9033309548b86caa2c4a8b3474b283761954d56775fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7798214103213f38bfd3b215",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真珠は日が沈んで尚、輝きを増す。\r\n満天の星と私…どちらがより強く\r\n輝くか、試してみたいわね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34b9301c05292d9d622c26dd448e0c529004ee581f8bf629ced2a4bb7ce128a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b4100563dfcf29adf9e50bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "眠りに落ちても、貴方は私という\r\n存在を意識せずにはいられない…。\r\nグッナイ。また夢の中で、ね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef8dd0e3745589f3e8336b152f819010fc81c439347827486aeb4485d86b2f57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a67c047be2c895def795acf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春は目覚めの季節ね。花が咲き、\r\n鳥が歌い…そして私が踊り出す！\r\nつまり私が踊ればいつでも春！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a454120f6cc49d0a1616e008871b8d136c113f3fba0a0af035ff2a5b6caf020a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adab27db794dce6766b517a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "熱中症には気をつけてね。\r\n私のパッションにあてられたら…\r\nもう心の熱は下がらないわよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "76facbf4db15075c437f5255379db1f906abda61768100608439e09d6bbcb6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96eb1ffd4e67ca1a81d4f30a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋は月が綺麗というけれど…。\r\n神秘的なムーンライトを浴びた\r\nパールがどう輝くか…見たくない？",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a1cd08a7e79985f0bf44716315414d77a5b71df71deb18d544f010de1afa68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd421446b2f08f3334920486",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真珠という存在が最も光輝く季節…\r\nそう！それが冬！ンン～、つまり\r\n最高に私の季節ってコトよね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b17bbf37d4cb9ac21ac2cdec8ff6bd73f5b06e11f63533a131ebfb103ab1cd55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad19ba628a92052a6e324c5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy valentine！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7495dfd2852935ccd1589743a9237bd9120536054bbd56b0f547251c0fdd4cd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8837360abf448828d7297635",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタインよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21aeb9f4268cb0ea4aa611560190e360e14d5c22bc99b562539159ae8de54373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4480fc481fc00ae8e61e6f64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次大树对着我「BANG！」，\r\n我都会用逼真演技抓住子弹挡下来，\r\nAnd～对她丢回去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cb3211398a8c2966d6f399f556c6f0a0d35433a0d565035e11e699dc08388cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aaf457f090259b2449497e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多伯邀请我参加目白家茶会。\r\n我手边刚好有些\r\n光明应该会喜欢的茶叶呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef2b1796f45d333f791e637882aa2fef2482c62989681b34fa9aef6792be5ec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acc041bb3ba9c3aeb5eed91a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听川上说，我昨天似乎\r\n又在睡梦中唱歌了喔……\r\nIt's dream recital……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b6f49f5fbf719edd74bd917bfe81314ca65a7295623bab4305855261a5d4635",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a25b3114878bb9c8bf24972c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我很擅长pantomime喔♪\r\n嗯～～～喝！看啊！\r\n现在浮在我手中的是……this地球！",
      "source_fingerprint": "879fa86920590ad86fafe71318d8922c6f4c8e751841e06cc18dc156613284c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9131241cddcd5afad69a9ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Pappy因为工作get了世上的各种\r\n宝石……但一定没有任何一种宝石\r\n能赢过Mammy跟我吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbc82734a0e9d1712fd5b5e8d0164c708eecb7d01379f982380f322d852c741c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50774ca3bce911d80cc4cc08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然穿上这套服装……\r\n就得尽情dancing！singing！\r\n迈向闪耀的future……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "777453cc17e575251fbf3a0a16adb7d2db7a29d37decedad86b6ed055f49328c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a552fad4609baa81b420ace2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢healthy地露出肌肤喔♪\r\n嗯嗯～尽情解放的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43cfaab9baf187d72fe0492be3804f33f1ecd845ecb7c54d42cbeea67e4e34d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b776d0de57eae1ce8f86593d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这上面有几颗珍珠呢……？\r\nOne、two、three……嗯～！\r\n一定是无限颗！数也数不完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47fa86ab984099f98cf0b142ffa6b5bbc136898eb591dfe35934c05f59e4fbf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c99d42e599052d2c837d61f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有个地方被称为「地球的肚脐」……\r\n采珠我的肚脐也很美，\r\n毫不逊色吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c5d80169f517ba297f7ddb0c16427b989ca16ba610130c6844b78fa129ede3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc34360cadf2898bf8db27cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hey训练员！早上要不要跟我\r\n来dance一下提提神呢？还是……\r\n要听我发自灵魂的shout？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c496e6c78d997ed65e1bda84acf447156a73d9675bcf284de76f2e50a307bb19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d011e7a6dd2e5e63a178f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在这时间……可以认为是「已经\r\n下午了」也可想成「才下午而已！」\r\n不同心态将决定今日一天的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2b773b62381c2f6712ee7bb1ea7641f70a79461b31fc9186392b6ed327030d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5037203947d1ff8293c3b26c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡不着的夜晚我会阅读哲学书籍。\r\n边读边认真思考……\r\n嗯～～thinking的采珠……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e57c845d3e7bc9f2d0469752614b34df7a17cbaf020122ef1dbb48fdc3d8cdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27ef6c3dcc995e2b0d2b437b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没穿制服的时候都会被新生\r\n误认成老师呢。\r\n看我的强者气场！Fabulous！",
      "source_fingerprint": "408eb25fc21c431a39acef5016b54d6d1ffb89d96746b9118b081ae87b9f29aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e89df10890e48f4db40a16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真希望度假文化能更深入日本呢。\r\n我希望训练员也能去\r\n好好refresh一番！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fecaf730f9b3b1edd8ba85bd3fb45fc5f1f91db14f3aa5a6045a2b19a46023df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a46ba9d400f37f5b5d833f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得听到铃虫的call时会很想\r\n回复它们吗？像这样……铃铃\r\n……hey？铃铃铃☆heyhey～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ebb66161bcf0466f6efee276e58059f0f45ffa2d6b6d23c7be87d45b0265a8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1726dab9a2f7b91a6287f9e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "No干燥！美容秘诀在于保湿！\r\n「美肌与实力都仰赖日常累积！」\r\n关键就是要像珍珠一样一层层累积！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad8b6a3b1e97b8f70477f3f3f5bec7dc36ebef977bed41044bc357cb8197cd0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:015afeb6f28b28543f3fbb7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マヤノは物事の本質を捉えてるわ。\r\nいつか世界の全てを理解したなら…\r\n『ディス地球』を託せるかもね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67ab57d7051b5dd2d8cffb603243fe95db638d0cbf21e357ae450d39318d1ff1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c44f828e2e4fecd88727753",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フクキタルの占いに出たの…\r\n『幸福の鍵はロケットにある』と！\r\nさあ目指すわよ！スペースGⅠを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c9ea89b505ac1979427ad3fed51790a232c56e9b714634026d0b6f65bd1caa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569579eaca50b9be6b10c9ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "グラスの日本舞踊に宿る美しい\r\n『詫び寂び』…私のダンスと\r\n融合すれば～～アメイジングッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8afab6ec9640e713b389954f2980275aef033acb6b58b859ef57f28bb68c8ca0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1478012b9d30e2beaa40d146",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アケボノの作るちゃんこ鍋…。\r\n繊細な出汁と合わせ味噌の深いコク\r\n…まさに！インプレッションッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d30ae1cd53483f47ac7fc95b8858e64d92936095dc333bdbe777e20683c78f78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96379ab87172073274c67171",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔女としてはスイープの方が先輩。\r\n『やりたい事』が無限の魔力の源…\r\n世界は広いわ…ブリ～リアントッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ba87e94bc3d9e309a597870068dc9ec96977353ef9a1351b5fad73ea964f7c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfec2aaab28cf12db43cf6df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ンッン～♪パッショネイッ！\r\n眠たそうな貴方に情熱の魔法を。\r\n踊り出さずにはいられないはずよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ed9f4b8bd102f14a63259d0d4715e27cd07db9e026b3420f6390cbc96289194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d77c0247e78bc34b2efec8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘイ、トレーナー！調子はどう？\r\n私は好調すぎてトレーニングが\r\n待ちきれないわ！ダンシンッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa6cfda207dc4ede7412078eec42e79a989db7f0919e17948b397810967cfd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:320ff9318ddaf01ffe59991b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界を変える者にも休息は必要よ。\r\n今度私の情熱ソング弾き語り音源を\r\n…お休みBGMとして進呈するわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5808bc1cc63ec1aa356ed40988406b665522f6e78154fea461b3f2ecacc91fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4657552621cdbe3e94c050ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スプリングスリープ…春の眠りは\r\n心地いいというけれど。毎日快眠の\r\n私には関係なかったわね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22664c2e3c155c95ecf38f4db00b9fb06bf3d756d95a1dac4e5f54c29f2d117f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf7e11175d23d079869de059",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏のレースは大変だけど、好きよ。\r\n何か世界を変える大きな事を\r\n見せられそうな気がするから♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c67fc619beb9d46b67614cd38c60ea88210662c5eec148440f37fe4c37cac3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0db825ab38a6db7e41432d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜が長くなってくる時期よね。\r\n私もよく窓辺で考え事をするの…\r\n今度の遠征はどの弁当にするかを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29225908daeac0f3ed76e797a262eab9f81f7461ded7322c3a253041f7bc162c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59316e2f53a4c44a68878b40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなに寒くても、私の走りで…\r\n溢れるパッションで温めるわ♪\r\nそれがファビュラス・パールよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5c90593f7d6d50e020fc7e77f57db5745e8b1d0cfb9f3b34e9035526c89ee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6bb68a77a12fdb6bf1bc6eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流れ星さえ従えて、大地を見下ろす\r\n輝き1つ。夜空にたなびく軌跡を\r\n見つけたら…それは私かも、ね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c945820436a675d688382cffae1a567e63fea4df88d5503ef1825d1496e2f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b73b6816c089b58705b8d713",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミステリアス…＆エレガンツッ！\r\n魔女と星空の旅はいかがかしら？\r\n貴方なら連れて行ってあげるわよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "54427fdddbe1a62941c8e6059cf7627cb977814d53aeea41f1875ce4102c40d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2dbb466c0af189274b37001",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，active地向前进！\r\n以世界为目标努力训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee5741f454bfe850c84020744bc9864c214b4bce9ad03f7bae2123722d667f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e6e5c271f720545bd7cf6fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd6cea31bb2ba5a7a34cc6f72aedf60a9538d8f61dd5fddc60e275e5043f039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9641ffcb6e487aac755f80a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "珍珠是因为珍珠质层经过层层累积\r\n才终于能散发光芒……\r\n也是因此越变越big的喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dc779db939b5144a2f5e3dce488525a2118aedf940292868bf28d2127f257b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1189941153287ed390291d32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我事先做好warm-up跟\r\n采珠式冥想了。\r\n来吧，here we go♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f0419101059446f2ad1053ab347825f743e21c42b075f848cc0229749164a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ff7d3075d605874b66f9fca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越努力训练就会越期待\r\nbathtime呢♪\r\n好啦，我要挥洒shine的汗水～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be9523585ece42f7dead3abffdca6c915b2fdedbcb94c9f1133c1a15706a2e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2c61d5e694abfa0b425c32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，come on！\r\n让我看看你的heart！\r\n你想好进军世界的plan了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8d2f488f9f08d98225da652fc639bda2a4ab04bb5b27fbe7dd268c9efb7f3c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b63db09e20b9032b7d164d41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要交给你就一定没问题。\r\n我会相信你的判断不断奔跑……！\r\n好啦，今天也要加油喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "294b831b95d7a82afd6354196744b29380f080dfac817473db60c48faa14b612",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3110179c44182bc8b8b7d76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就是最高级的花珠珍珠……！\r\n由你亲手打磨完成的最顶级宝石。\r\n呵呵……你要让我更加闪耀喔……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "824232cbb6d58afebf0fa31284e09eefad427d4fc44579dfe0a2bf59ee14516e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97f1d8bd85ff70c1ba255ec5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "练习结束后我会喝碗fresh的海鲜汤\r\ncharge水分跟盐分！\r\n呵呵……疲劳瞬间一扫而空♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ba301fcb0f03a32450f4548c3d76a48995346f54f5688014303765abeb89da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33d066b4e6b9a24c56716e52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フィジカル・イズ・マ～ジカルッ！\r\n極限まで磨き上げた走りは魔法と\r\n区別がつかないわ！アンダスタン？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a1e2f8032c6eed2d0bc93f308a24a365d75d34cbb2f3e45b123452f8c675739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59428ef49c318a592c980503",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界中に無限の可能性を示すっ！\r\n魔女ならそのくらいはやらなきゃ、\r\nエレガントとは言えないわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "264590eb9e4b32efba5a8716d1bace74d5614aea13432e15d7cc16cb3e82844d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7470f4116e17aed378dfc85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ンッフフ～♪来たわねトレーナー！\r\nイメトレは万全よ！レースから\r\nウイニングライブまで！フッフ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e852a7fabb5f40a3454bb649668be38e508a3005960efd7162bc48bd55792c6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d28631f3e5745256c000a2cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水分以外に塩分補給もマスト要件！\r\n消化吸収にもいい赤出汁味噌汁よ。\r\n貴方の分も作ってきてあげたわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17bbf43c75e80fe7ea4132b7beafd7d27ac789a9c9933636b3d9296d3f1b832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a7f53a8107c747d522fd7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今ならロケットエンジンさえ\r\n敵ではないわ。ディス地球だって\r\n90分で1周できるくらいに、ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce419262fdac4767469694722b94c06c3a653d2511335d5a5f8e2bf6e7176b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2811727bfa96a7dcc47bb7e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『不可能を可能にする魔法』…。\r\nそれは自分を疑わない者の力よ！\r\nビリービンッ・インフィニティッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99523f6a4b1656a0d00d3ab2d17a07d82278fd947ed3a944b19b8f7ad282ae17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:844f00858cf7baa57e519616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私という真珠は貴方によって輝き…\r\n流星のように眩しく世界を照らす。\r\nン～、ザッツワンダフルマジック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca7b3bf1cba6554615c4ce2858f0c4397e6d5d6f283c8ec4415cf58b08ee7c7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f84999ccf5dfa4076af48eea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "My dear！都要感谢你的支持！",
      "source_fingerprint": "839152486f94e868a5fe2b629db09108b5eb3bb50f43c31d9a3f33337a9aa9c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1566d0f7ca76bd8e1b3d40df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Amazing！挑战世界之路还没结束！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a304b64cd676fc6b8e8fc851eb906601ad1c9022e1d95ac2efba9f247ef893d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1cb23a714b531f1ae1c3875",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私たちなら…銀河の果てにさえ辿り着けるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b95c3d3c80ac8f07158688a57f3ead5b3e58d237bb29f24e2a8d832bef99c722",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d7fff6ebef54894da61668c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファビュラスマジ～ック！楽しめた？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b1fbbb1bb9d9e8388a433699c31c4b0d2bba0a704d83b4a41c84ab11fc562d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b39ddf6f34af86bc68c648e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要更加更加shine！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3431a079e82021f151d631f51378e856d3ca965eacf345e9210d2209e18435f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5904f1e8baa321343f1563a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes☆超越极限……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb01b7a77961d5109c7277d0fb67dd35439951532384873f7ff10bf6818910e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e8ed17de3e32729a7000a9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～！我叫做采珠喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab4252e289a070000cb33401671534810c96d602ea784b496dad65b6c171d7f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65749b760bcc264bed763798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想要的是金色珍珠？还是\r\n银色珍珠？嗯～或者是……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee7a1f9a3c19c6c9fa59eea8174a6628cd505df73aef8c930315f797cda6e11c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec97bafe8e2e3612907e0ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没错，还要再更加耀眼……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3766ee1ea416b7d6d5ae1a5e0cdb1fdc3430755d6322b83919a1c51ee4a321fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:163e697afa653935c7101d2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就是世界级的水平了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed7b0f083db16d6cbff08728204fa9819bd68591ad59e9edcc68bafc14c3bcd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66b0f43fe4e6678f7bb1d85e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の魔力…高まってきたわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ecded644ecfd3a784fc8e8ec6286f3ea2ef160c5d60b70f1cc98ff0166dcb21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc058d1ad01d69aa77892c9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パールの魔法に…\r\n限界はナッシンッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c88b1c9d1fd97f0e7893e0077cbdad1ad72c3181d2e43d53d7d47ecb29b68d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f63d0a86618b6d40aabb5ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の魔法は…\r\n世界さえ塗り替えるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28664f030dd681a85a2fcd5fbfbfd9876ba3e6adf3be171bb4045dcfa1eed95b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c871f2a11513823eb39a61fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ンッン～♪魔女シーキングザパールよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6636b9b8b9872ab5ed27378074b3b7d6f7ad181d3d9fed1f6d0b675d1e28ddae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12985bb838aeed293cace6c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一口气向前咬！",
      "source_fingerprint": "daf544a0feaa093887ac76c224c71b25778a97997c516210b64839e9149ba907",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab83f13d737128eaf4f8b02a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风是最强最棒的！\r\n不过……最先注意到这一点的你\r\n实力也算不赖啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b924d6a9c1ef80e433367459dd5bcc11e71ff57387b2e7390af9f58c6f4ee591",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:139d5ab3286a0ca9ae5e65fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるのだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecfa6f2a9fbd62300178208e1db094da30ca1882946a0529810e5ceb85dc4bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3936d34b072b317a4bc71527",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったのだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3301b90602a739d7aa1e050365eb4d3b0345ff8174d90a7127f95dac1464955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "100001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
